gemini-3.5-flash.text:
{
  "brief": "Indiana's defense had no answers for a Golden State expansion offense that clicked from the opening tip, leaving the Fever chasing shadows in an 88-75 Valkyries road win tonight. Valkyries guard Courtney Vandersloot controlled the floor with 12 assists tonight, carving up the lane before the Fever's help defense could rotate. Indiana's 18 turnovers tonight derailed any hope of a late-game run, spoiling a 22-point night from Aliyah Boston."
}
